COMPONENT DELIBERATELY REMOVED
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  gmsh                      GPL-2.0-or-later
                            https://gmsh.info

conda-forge's FreeCAD package declares gmsh as a run dependency for finite-
element meshing. This worker never meshes, and gmsh would be the only strong-
copyleft component in the image, so the Dockerfile removes it after the
environment is solved (`conda remove --force gmsh`). FreeCAD's FEM workbench
is therefore not functional in this image; nothing here uses it.

